# This machine

This file is private and is never committed. Populate facts from installed tools and project configuration rather than guessing them.

- Use the tool's execution and polling controls instead of a shell `timeout` wrapper on macOS.
- Prefer Android CLI if installed. Otherwise discover the Android SDK tools and use their supported commands.
- Discover available AVDs with the installed emulator's `-list-avds` command. Select phone, tablet, minimum SDK and 16 KB devices based on the task and actual installed images.
- Read ticket prefixes, default branches, variants, application IDs and build tasks from the target repository. No global project default is assumed.
- Command and patch guards require trust through Codex `/hooks` before they run.
